### Enhancements

* Track the last time an environment was activated via user invocation. Activation modifies the mtime of `<prefix>/conda-meta/last_activated` (best-effort; failures are ignored). The timestamp is exposed `last_activated` in json output or under new `Last Active` heading in newly reformated `conda env list` table format. (#14308 via #16808)
* `PrefixData` now has is_active property. (#14308 via #16808)

